  "problem": "The fifth-degree Taylor polynomial of $f(x)$ about $x=1$ is given by\n\n$$\n{P}_{5}(x)=6+12(x-1)+9(x-1)^{2}+4(x-1)^{3}+\\frac{5}{4}(x-1)^{4}+\\frac{3}{10}(x-1)^{5}.\n$$\n\nWhat is ${f}^{(5)}(1)?$\n\n${f}^{(5)}(1)=$\n{{field-1}}",
